Bitcoin HTLC must use OP_SHA256 <H> OP_EQUALVERIFY style or the typical script:

IF
  <receiver_pubkey> OP_CHECKSIGVERIFY
  OP_SHA256 <H> OP_EQUAL
ELSE
  <refund_pubkey> OP_CHECKSIGVERIFY
  <timelock> OP_CHECKLOCKTIMEVERIFY OP_DROP
ENDIF
(Exact script variants vary; the important part is OP_SHA256 <H> OP_EQUAL.)

