bool — boolean

Address — canonical 20-byte address (EVM) or mapped address for SVM

Bytes — dynamic byte array

FixedBytes<N> — fixed-length byte arrays

String — UTF-8 string (for human data only; expensive on-chain)

Timestamp (alias to u64)

Duration (alias to u64) — seconds

Composite types:

struct (fields public/private)

enum (tagged union)

array<T> and map<K,V> — maps are backed by storage helpers in stdlib

Special types:

