9. Gas model and metering
Compiler injects gas_meter::charge(n: u64) calls at predictable points (function prologue, loop iterations, heavy ops like hashing, storage reads/writes). The IR annotates each op with a gas baseline.

Gas primitives available: gas_left(), refund_gas(amount) (backend may choose to honor refunds).

Standard library functions document gas cost.

10. Cryptographic primitives
Stdlib provides:

Crypto::keccak256(bytes) -> FixedBytes<32>

