13. Error handling
require(cond, message) aborts with revert-style semantics (state reverted, gas consumed up to point). EVM backend will use revert with ABI-encoded message.

assert for internal invariants (may consume all gas and cause panic)

try/catch for external call wrappers in IR (where supported by target)

