Map X3 types to Solidity/EVM types with explicit casting rules.

Emulate maps using storage helpers and keccak256-derived keys.

Insert gas metering ops for loops and heavy primitives.

For heavy stdlib like big-int math or multi-precision, prefer native precompiles or host shims.

Provide a --emit-asm option for debugging emitted EVM opcodes.

