Compiler emits:

abi.json: functions and events with types mapped to target ABI structures

metadata.json: sourceHash, compiler version, optimization flags

sourcemap: mapping IR -> source lines for debugging

ABI decisions:

Map X3 types to ABI types: u256 -> uint256, Address -> address, Bytes -> bytes

For backends lacking native ABI, produce JSON metadata for off-chain tooling.

